{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848640/extras/b9f07942813a6e0626313ca4ad1390ce.poster.avif?t=1752429792\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848640/extras/b9f07942813a6e0626313ca4ad1390ce.webm?t=1752429792\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848640/extras/b9f07942813a6e0626313ca4ad1390ce.mp4?t=1752429792\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">What Kind of Game is it ?\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Juniper: A Scrapbooking Adventure is a short-but-sweet cozy game featuring a series of open levels in a fairytale-esque setting, which you can explore at your own pace. You will meet a lovable cast of characters as you help Juniper complete requests for her sister and the locals whilst documenting the world around you for your zaney siste.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Adventure</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play at your own pace as you explore three unique and adventure-packed islands as well as some extra-secret areas and quests, if you're able to find them. There's no need to rush to complete the game, as there are plenty of fun interactions and conversations to be had off the beaten path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Unique Mechanics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take photos with your trusty camera and fill out your compendium of all the wildlife on the islands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848640/extras/a5f2367f90f5e3a81b9a5b2cd9f7ccab.poster.avif?t=1752429792\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848640/extras/a5f2367f90f5e3a81b9a5b2cd9f7ccab.webm?t=1752429792\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848640/extras/a5f2367f90f5e3a81b9a5b2cd9f7ccab.mp4?t=1752429792\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Or perhaps stick the photos in your trusty scrapbook, alongside mementoes and gifts from fellow islanders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848640/extras/cc15a7c68cc0eee816d8b6af213326d5.poster.avif?t=1752429792\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848640/extras/cc15a7c68cc0eee816d8b6af213326d5.webm?t=1752429792\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848640/extras/cc15a7c68cc0eee816d8b6af213326d5.mp4?t=1752429792\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3848640?t=1752429792","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848640/60385dfbb9a1ca19f586c8270cbad2d0c8f67699/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1752429792","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848640/e7ccf5ab8887d5d1c21d74ba51339ed9d0de494c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752429792","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848640/e7ccf5ab8887d5d1c21d74ba51339ed9d0de494c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752429792","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"c